      "narration": [
        "The fix: during training, a second agent plays the harness.",
        "The student model proposes its next step.",
        "The harnessing agent reviews it, using the harness's rules.",
        "Sound steps pass unchanged.",
        "Weak ones get the smallest fix.",
        "The plain harness runs it.",
        "The result joins the student's own history."
      ],
